* InternVL3_5-8B-HF .............. Apache License 2.0        (OpenGVLab)
* InternVL3_5-2B-HF .............. Apache License 2.0        (OpenGVLab)
* gemma-3-12b-it ................. Gemma Terms of Use        (Google) — GATED

  The Gemma models are governed by the Gemma license
